                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-7" value="- 비디오 소스(카메라)에서 생성된 영상이 사용자에게 &lt;br&gt;전달되기까지 데이터가 거쳐가는 물리적인 장치들" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="318" y="1680" width="280" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-8" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-9" target="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-10" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-9" value="&lt;b&gt;Streaming Server&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 비디오 소스에서 영상을 수신&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- 시청자들의 다양한 네트워크 환경에 대응하기 위해 수신한 영상을 가공하는 중앙 관리 서버&lt;br&gt;- 고화질의 원본 영상을 여러가지 화질 버전으로 가공&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- 가공 데이터를 CDN으로 전송&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6D3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="306" y="1900" width="306" height="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-10" value="&lt;b&gt;CDN&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- CDN = Content Deliver Network&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 모든 사용자가 하나의 메인 서버에 접속하는 것은 네트워크 트래픽과 물리적 거리에 대한 한계가 있음&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 지리적으로 분산된 Edge Server를 두고, 영상을 캐싱하여 중앙 서버를 거치지 않고 곧바로 사용자에게 제공&lt;br&gt;- Edge Server는 미국, 유럽 아시아 등 전세계에 거점을 둠&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6D3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="306" y="2110" width="304" height="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-11" value="&lt;b&gt;User Devices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 미디어 데이터를 최종적으로 수신하고 사용자에게 제공&lt;br&gt;- CDN으로부터 영상을 수신&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6D3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="312" y="2320" width="306" height="110" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-12" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.479;entryY=-0.015;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" parent="1" source="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-10" target="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-11" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-13" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;스트리밍을 위한 여러가지 기술&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="910" y="1530" width="330" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-14" value="- 저지연, 효율적인 스트리밍을 위한 여러가지 기법과 프로토콜" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="910" y="1590" width="330" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-15" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6D3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="896" y="1680" width="424" height="440" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-16" value="&lt;b&gt;Video Source&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1040" y="1700" width="100" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-17" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;" parent="1" source="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-18" target="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-20" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-18" value="&lt;b&gt;Encoder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 원본 미디어 데이터를 네트워크로 전송하기 적합하게 압축&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-&amp;nbsp; 압축 알고리즘을 코덱이라고 부르며, 가장 보편적인 표준 기술로는 H.264, H.265가 있음&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 데이터의 압축률과 지연 시간 사이의 트레이드 오프에서 Low Latency 설정 적용 가능&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="940" y="1750" width="312" height="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-19" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-20" target="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-22" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-20" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ingest 프로토콜&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 인코딩된 데이터를 빠르게 서버로 업스트림 전송하기 위한 프로토콜&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- RTMP, WebRTC 두 개의 프로토콜이 있음&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="940" y="1940" width="312" height="130" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-21" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b&gt;RTMP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;- RTMP = Real-Time Messaging Protocol&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 기존 인프라에서 가장 널리 쓰이는 빠르고 안정적인 단방향 업스트림 전송 방식&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1380" y="1890" width="240" height="130" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-22" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;WebRTC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;- WebRTC = Web Real-Time Communication&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 브라우저 기반의 양방향 초저지연 통신에 특화&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- P2P 또는 SFU 구성에서 1초 미만의 실시간성이 필요할 때 사용&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1380" y="2050" width="240" height="130" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-23" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.385;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-20" target="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-21" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-24" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6D3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="890" y="2240" width="558" height="630" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-25" value="&lt;b&gt;Streaming Server&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1155" y="2260" width="120" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-26" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-15" target="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-24" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-27" value="&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(52, 59, 89); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, Ubuntu, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;Transcoding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(52, 59, 89); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, Ubuntu, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 원본 미디어 데이터를 다양한 해상도(1080p, 720p, 480p)로 변환&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 지연에 대비하여 클라이언트 환경에 맞게 화질 옵션을 선택&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1016" y="2310" width="372" height="90" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-28" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-29" target="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-30" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-29" value="&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(52, 59, 89); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, Ubuntu, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;Compression&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(52, 59, 89); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, Ubuntu, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 네트워크 대역폭을 부담을 줄이기 위해 압축&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1046" y="2450" width="332" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-30" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Low Buffer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 지연 시간을 감소하기 위해 서버에서 데이터를 모으는 단위를 최소화하여 CDN으로 전송&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1035" y="2565" width="360" height="95" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-31" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-33" target="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-36" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-32" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-33" target="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-37" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-33" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Optimization&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;-&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;지연 시간을 줄이기 위한 모든 계산&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 영상을 작은 단위로 쪼개고 사용자의 네트워크 상태에 적합한 화질의 데이터를 전송하는 등의 작업을 수행&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Bitrate Control,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;GOP,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Cashe &amp;amp; CDN 연동&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1016" y="2690" width="360" height="95" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-34" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-27" target="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-29" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-35" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.516;entryY=-0.008;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" parent="1" source="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-30" target="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-33" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="djloTv2OwbFXEbQ8ZcZW-36" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dynamic Bite Rate Control&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;-&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;클라이언트의 네트워크 환경에 따라 고화질 대용량 / 저화질 저용량 데이터를 선택적으로 전송&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; text-align: start; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BOptimization%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3B-%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%20Bitrate%20Control%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20GOP%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Cashe%20%26amp%3Bamp%3B%20CDN%20%EC%97%B0%EB%8F%99%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D1%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%221008%22%20y%3D%222750%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%2295%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
